@V := "tape" :: spec [active]
  version = "1.0"

@H 1180 := "kosmos LANE-count self-tunes to anchor COMPLEXITY — with an explicit SATURATION knee + a SHUFFLE control (the two clauses H_1164's proposal left untested)" :: universe [🔴 CLOSED-NEG GEOMETRIC-MODE-COUNTING — lane-count tracks K but is SHUFFLE-BLIND (counts spatial modes, not temporal regime structure) and shows NO saturation knee]
  seed         = "H_1164 established: live kosmos lane = 'cell_'+cell_id passthrough (⏳ BLOCKED) + a toy PROPOSAL that lane-count rises with K (Spearman 0.881), advantage, max-bounded. H_1164 did NOT test (a) an explicit SATURATION KNEE on a finer K ladder, nor (b) a SHUFFLE control (anti-Goodhart: real complexity-tracking must FAIL when temporal regime-onset structure is destroyed). H_1180 adds exactly those two missing legs."
  substrate    = "PROPOSAL on the 5-channel kosmos tension_5ch geometry. Reuses h1159b VERBATIM (import run_arm/assign/make_stream/cohen_d/spearman); ONLY change DIM 8->5 (exactly H_1164's proposal) + finer K ladder {2,3,4,5,6,8,10,12} to expose a knee. lane-count == MITOSIS-arm final cell-count. Live lane stays cell_id passthrough = ⏳ BLOCKED (a_core_engine_map·a_kosmos), UNCHANGED from H_1164. local python3.12/numpy $0 CPU 10 seeds deterministic."
  method       = "FROZEN FALSIFIER (pre-reg, 10 seeds 800-809, g5/p7): F1 TRACKS Spearman(K,lane-count)>=0.8 on the REAL onset-structured stream. F2 SATURATION top-half marginal lane-gain/K < 0.6x bottom-half (concave knee, self-limiting). F3 SHUFFLE-CONTROL on a TEMPORALLY-SHUFFLED stream (same samples, onset structure destroyed) lane-count must NOT track K: Spearman_shuf<0.5 AND real-shuf>=0.3. SUPPORTED iff F1&F2&F3 (a_paper_negative_ok)."
  result       = "🔴 CLOSED-NEGATIVE (1/3 gates). F1 PASS: Spearman_real(K,lane-count)=0.965>=0.8 — lane-count cleanly rises with K (real means 3.0/3.7/4.6/5.3/6.1/7.9/9.3/11.2 for K=2..12). F2 SATURATION FAIL: bottom-half gain 0.775/K, top-half gain 0.85/K, ratio=1.097 (>=0.6 bar; NO knee — lane-count rises LINEARLY, even slightly ACCELERATING, within K<=12; MAX_CELLS=20 cap never binds). F3 SHUFFLE-CONTROL FAIL hard: Spearman_shuffled=0.992 (>0.5 bar) — the SHUFFLED stream tracks K JUST AS WELL (even higher); real-minus-shuffled=-0.027 (<0.3). Shuffled lane means 2.0/3.0/4.0/5.0/5.9/7.9/9.5/11.2 ~= real."
  finding      = "The proposed lane-partition counts SPATIAL CLUSTER GEOMETRY, NOT temporal regime-onset COMPLEXITY. The split rule fires on nearest-prototype assignment-distance, which is PURELY GEOMETRIC: it sees the same K spatial modes whether they arrive in onset order or fully time-shuffled, so lane-count tracks the number of spatial clusters (=K) identically in both arms. The F3 shuffle control did EXACTLY its anti-Goodhart job — it revealed that 'lane-count tracks K' (H_1164's 0.881) is mode-COUNTING indistinguishable from sample-geometry, NOT complexity-tracking. And no saturation knee appears below K=12 (the cap is not the limiter; growth is linear). H_1164's 🟢 proposal was UNDER-CONTROLLED; with the shuffle control it is a closed-negative."
  discovery    = "SERENDIP: the shuffle control flips H_1164's apparent win. The geometric split-rule is TIME-BLIND by construction — temporal STRUCTURE (regime onset order, the thing that makes a stream 'complex' over time rather than just spatially multi-modal) is INVISIBLE to it. This ties H_1166/H_1179 (live field is stream/time-blind) on the toy axis: BOTH the live engine AND the toy partition-rule are blind to TEMPORAL structure — the live field ignores the stream entirely, the toy rule ignores its time-ordering. A genuinely complexity-tracking lane would need a TEMPORAL/recurrence-sensitive split signal (e.g. surprise on a predictive model), not a static geometric distance. The missing ingredient is the same one (temporal coupling) on both substrates."
  honesty      = "🔴 is a clean closed-negative, NOT goalpost-moved: the shuffle control was pre-registered BEFORE measuring and it fired; F2's knee bar was frozen. p7 (assignment-distance partition, NOT perplexity). The PROPOSAL framing is preserved (live lane = cell_id passthrough = ⏳ BLOCKED, unchanged). Reused h1159b VERBATIM (DIM 8->5 only). a_completeness_over_cheap: this is the proper re-test of H_1164's under-controlled 🟢, not a cheap recheck."
  verdict_tier = "🔴 CLOSED-NEG GEOMETRIC-MODE-COUNTING (proposal; toy $0; live lane ⏳ BLOCKED cf H_1164) — terminal. Sharpens/supersedes H_1164's proposal-🟢 by adding the shuffle control it lacked."
  scope         = "PROPOSAL on 5-ch anchor geometry (NOT live kosmos lane = cell_id passthrough = BLOCKED). toy numpy $0 CPU 10 seeds; scale UNVERIFIED (a_scale_honest_scope)."
  artifact      = "UNIVERSE/h1180_kosmos_lane_self_tune.py · .verdicts/1180_kosmos_lane_self_tune/H_1180.txt"
  xref          = "1164_kosmos_lane_self_tuning · h1159b_mitosis_capacity_self_tuning · h1166_live_adaptation · 1179_live_recovery_curve · a_kosmos · a_core_engine_map · a_paper_negative_ok · a_completeness_over_cheap · a_scale_honest_scope · p7"
